.SH NAME
gmb-doc-langmatrix - Print the per-language grounding depth matrix


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgmb doc langmatrix [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Grades every embedded language fixture across the seven grounding
dimensions (signatures, doc-comments, call-edges, errors, concurrency,
config, tests) and prints the Markdown report table. With --json, prints
the per-language grade reports as JSON instead.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for langmatrix

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Emit machine-readable JSON output


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--color\fP="auto"
	Color output mode: auto|always|never

.PP
